data/train.labeled.jsonl — TEACHER-LABELED TRAINING DATA
========================================================

These ~400 gold labels were generated by a strong open model served by
Tinker (teacher model: openai/gpt-oss-120b) using the PROWAG-grounded rubric in
src/rubric.py, via src/label_train.py. They are MODEL-GENERATED, not
human gold. Every row carries "teacher_labeled": true and the teacher
model id. followup_instruction is recomputed deterministically from the
rubric (not taken from the model).

This disclosure must be surfaced in the write-up. The HELD-OUT eval gold
(data/heldout.labeled.jsonl) is DIFFERENT: it is hand-labeled by a human
via src/label_heldout.py and must never be model-generated.
